      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَرْيَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Milk collected</i> [<i>in the udder</i>]: a poet says,
“<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكُلُّ ذِى صَرْيَةٍ لَا بُدَّ مَحْلُوبُ</span><br />
”
[<i>And whatever</i> udder <i>has milk must be milked</i>].
(TA.)

